5. Add test requirements for `src/hooks/useContent.ts`: verify that when `ContentstackContext` has `isLivePreview: true`, the fetch request includes `live_preview` and `preview_token` query parameters; verify `skipLivePreview: true` overrides context state and excludes preview params.

6. Add test requirements for `src/components/contentstack/ContentstackLink/ContentstackLink.tsx`: verify anchor `href` includes `live_preview=true` when context indicates preview mode; verify token is appended when present; verify existing query strings are merged without duplication.

7. Add test requirements for `src/context/ContentstackContext.ts`: verify Provider initializes `isLivePreview` and `previewToken` from `window.location.search` containing `live_preview=true` on mount; verify `setLivePreview` updates context state and syncs to URL params.
