3. **`src/hooks/useContent.ts`** — Added optional `options?: { skipLivePreview?: boolean }` argument and exposed `isLivePreview` / `previewToken` on the returned object. `getContentByKey` behaviour is identical for all existing callers (236+ components), so no breakage.

4. **`src/components/contentstack/ContentstackLink/ContentstackLink.tsx`** — Reads live-preview state from `useContent()` and, when active, appends `live_preview=true` and `preview_token` query params to outbound `href` via `URL` / `URLSearchParams` (which merge by key, preserving existing query strings). Malformed URLs are caught and the original href is returned unchanged — satisfying the verification criterion "invalid content update ⇒ page continues to display content without rendering an error state".

