- The execution plan called for "Provider initializes from URL params on mount" — I implemented this. The Provider is not yet wired into `_app.tsx` because that file is not in the allowed write list and modifying it would touch infrastructure outside scope. A future story can add `<ContentstackProvider>` wrapping the `<ContentstackContext.Provider>` line in `_app.tsx`.

